{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":27773,"name":"Wycliffe ","username":"Dorex45","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/dorex45/{size}/11851_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-23T21:17:34.883Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ePhase 2 of the CKB x Kaze Unitour began on Thursday, 19 November at Machakos University, and the turnout exceeded what we planned for. More than 180 students joined us for three hours of hands-on learning, and 95 of them left with a brand new self-custodial wallet on Kaze.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e59018f60e7031d54b95888d49ab7f6dd317f793.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/e59018f60e7031d54b95888d49ab7f6dd317f793\" title=\"1795461224556\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e59018f60e7031d54b95888d49ab7f6dd317f793_2_517x345.jpeg\" alt=\"1795461224556\" data-base62-sha1=\"wKO4ecVTczSigTH0jFsR5vesMVB\" width=\"517\" height=\"345\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e59018f60e7031d54b95888d49ab7f6dd317f793_2_517x345.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e59018f60e7031d54b95888d49ab7f6dd317f793_2_775x517.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e59018f60e7031d54b95888d49ab7f6dd317f793_2_1034x690.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"86938C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e1795461224556\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1392×928 170 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27773-why-we-run-the-unitour-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27773-why-we-run-the-unitour-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhy we run the Unitour\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMost students in Kenya have heard of Bitcoin, but very few have actually held their own keys. The Unitour exists to close that gap. We take Bitcoin and CKB education directly to campuses, and we make sure everyone leaves having done something real rather than just listened.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27773-what-we-covered-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27773-what-we-covered-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhat we covered\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe session ran from 14:00 to 17:00 and followed the same flow we use on every stop:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBitcoin 101:\u003c/strong\u003e what Bitcoin is, why it matters in Africa, and what self-custody really means\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCKB and Nervos:\u003c/strong\u003e the Layer 1 behind Kaze, including RGB++ and the Fiber Network\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKaze:\u003c/strong\u003e how contributors earn CKB for every approved location they map, and how they can cash out to M-Pesa\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive wallet setup:\u003c/strong\u003e students installed Kaze and created their own wallets in the room, step by step with our team\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLive mapping:\u003c/strong\u003e students added real places around campus and followed the leaderboard as pins were approved\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b0d2c3380053d0893ac5756313b6bbf7089e7ac7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/b0d2c3380053d0893ac5756313b6bbf7089e7ac7\" title=\"1795461224511\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b0d2c3380053d0893ac5756313b6bbf7089e7ac7_2_345x229.jpeg\" alt=\"1795461224511\" data-base62-sha1=\"pefAFQ5rnWamj9yidq7WRWuxdMr\" width=\"345\" height=\"229\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b0d2c3380053d0893ac5756313b6bbf7089e7ac7_2_345x229.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b0d2c3380053d0893ac5756313b6bbf7089e7ac7_2_517x343.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b0d2c3380053d0893ac5756313b6bbf7089e7ac7_2_690x458.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"C7BAB9\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e1795461224511\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1600×1066 288 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/b/bf7e73144dde76483eeddd07ebd4567a8c956980.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/bf7e73144dde76483eeddd07ebd4567a8c956980\" title=\"1795461224528\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/bf7e73144dde76483eeddd07ebd4567a8c956980_2_345x230.jpeg\" alt=\"1795461224528\" data-base62-sha1=\"rk2738XGeyQRDR556A5wOrHwHx6\" width=\"345\" height=\"230\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/bf7e73144dde76483eeddd07ebd4567a8c956980_2_345x230.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/bf7e73144dde76483eeddd07ebd4567a8c956980_2_517x345.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/bf7e73144dde76483eeddd07ebd4567a8c956980_2_690x460.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"C1B8AF\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e1795461224528\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1280 407 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27773-the-numbers-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27773-the-numbers-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eThe numbers\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e180+ attendees\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e95 new wallets created\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFirst stop of Phase 2, following the earlier stops of the tour\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0bfbfe68c585db70ebd55fd29b76c312f4aa906c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/0bfbfe68c585db70ebd55fd29b76c312f4aa906c\" title=\"1795461224547\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0bfbfe68c585db70ebd55fd29b76c312f4aa906c_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"1795461224547\" data-base62-sha1=\"1I194Ew5xP2iUGKNdccCiavS7jS\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0bfbfe68c585db70ebd55fd29b76c312f4aa906c_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0bfbfe68c585db70ebd55fd29b76c312f4aa906c_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0bfbfe68c585db70ebd55fd29b76c312f4aa906c_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"908D88\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e1795461224547\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1392×928 131 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27773-what-stood-out-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27773-what-stood-out-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhat stood out\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe live setup was the best part of the afternoon. Seeing a room of students create wallets at the same time, ask questions about their recovery phrases, and then start mapping places they walk past every day made the idea feel tangible. The question we heard most was how to cash out to M-Pesa, which shows how much the local offramp matters for adoption.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27773-challenges-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27773-challenges-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eChallenges\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo event runs perfectly, and we want to be open about what we had to solve on the day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA turnout bigger than planned.\u003c/strong\u003e We prepared for a smaller room, and more than 180 students came. A crowd that size is a good problem to have, but it stretched our space, our team and the one-on-one help we could give during wallet setup.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOur main videographer fell sick on the day.\u003c/strong\u003e Our lead videographer could not make it, and with little notice we paired up with a student videographer from the university. Working from our shooting SOP guides, the student captured the raw footage, and we are sending it to our main videographer to edit into the final content. This is why highlights from the event will land a little later than usual.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27773-thank-you-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27773-thank-you-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eThank you\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you to Machakos University and the students who showed up with curiosity and energy, and to the Nervos community for the continued support behind the tour: \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/nervosnetwork\"\u003e@NervosNetwork\u003c/a\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@ckbsamurai\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@NervosNation\u003c/span\u003e and \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@ckba_build\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-27773-whats-next-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-27773-whats-next-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhat’s next\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Unitour continues across Kenyan campuses. If you are a student, a club lead or a community builder and want the tour at your university, reach out to us at business@usekaze.app or on X at \u003cspan class=\"mention\"\u003e@usekaze\u003c/span\u003e. If you attended and want to keep learning, join the Kaze and CKB community groups and tell us what you want to see next.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can download Kaze at \u003ca href=\"https://usekaze.app\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eusekaze.app\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/3/32c765a3a51ee92f84aef5b43517cab64e59e9df.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/32c765a3a51ee92f84aef5b43517cab64e59e9df\" title=\"1795461224520\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/32c765a3a51ee92f84aef5b43517cab64e59e9df_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"1795461224520\" data-base62-sha1=\"7fd4WjeqIyOgLWHQnacoY3sl903\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/32c765a3a51ee92f84aef5b43517cab64e59e9df_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/32c765a3a51ee92f84aef5b43517cab64e59e9df_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/32c765a3a51ee92f84aef5b43517cab64e59e9df_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"B9B1A6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e1795461224520\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1280 471 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/e/ef1bea241951e252cc94d545e36d4992059a2e28.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/ef1bea241951e252cc94d545e36d4992059a2e28\" title=\"1795461224538\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef1bea241951e252cc94d545e36d4992059a2e28_2_690x460.jpeg\" alt=\"1795461224538\" data-base62-sha1=\"y7fVb0YGalpg1dS3liL64YnJWIg\" width=\"690\" height=\"460\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef1bea241951e252cc94d545e36d4992059a2e28_2_690x460.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef1bea241951e252cc94d545e36d4992059a2e28_2_1035x690.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ef1bea241951e252cc94d545e36d4992059a2e28_2_1380x920.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"8E8277\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\